# Packages only the Raspberry Pi 5 image gets. The kernel is Ubuntu's
# "raspi" flavour (BCM2712 support, Raspberry Pi device trees and overlays).
# flash-kernel keeps /boot/firmware up to date when the kernel is upgraded on
# the device; the builder copies the first kernel there itself.
linux-raspi
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-raspi
rpi-eeprom
flash-kernel

# Wireless
wpasupplicant
wireless-regdb
bluez
